00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:24,260
Imagine having to win over the girl of your dreams... every friggin' day.

2
00:08:36,521 --> 00:08:42,521
50 First Dates is a comedy, romance film directed by Peter Segal.

3
00:12:54,782 --> 00:13:00,782
Henry is a player skilled at seducing women.

4
00:17:13,043 --> 00:17:19,043
But when this veterinarian meets Lucy, a girl with a quirky problem when it comes to total
recall, he realizes it's possible to fall in love all over again…and again, and again.

5
00:21:31,304 --> 00:21:37,304
That's because the delightful Lucy has no short-term memory, so Henry must woo
her day after day until he finally sweeps her off her feet.

6
